# The Action runs on Linux runners. A CRLF in a shell script is not a style
# issue, it is a broken script: bash reads the carriage return as part of the
# interpreter path. Force LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh  text eol=lf
*.py  text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.md  text eol=lf
